DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ssmm device driver supports SMC91C9x and SMC91C1xx-based Ethernet in‐
     terfaces.

     The ISA attachment of the ssmm driver supports any SMC91C9x-based Ethernet
     interface on the ISA bus, including the EFA Info*Express SVC VLB inter‐
     face, and the on-board SMC91C9x Ethernet found in many embedded PCs and
     laptop docking stations.

     The PCMCIA attachment of the ssmm driver supports Megahertz X-JACK Ethernet
     cards, NewMedia BASICS Ethernet cards, and SMC EtherEZ 8020 series cards.

